WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.420
Jason Park, Filmmaker: Cocky is only&nbsp;
cocky if you're not able to back it up.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.660
Confidence is knowing that you already did&nbsp;
it and you can do it again and you're going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:17.280
to need confidence to get you where your&nbsp;
vision is at because a vision is only you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:25.500
seeing what is possible if you stick to the plan&nbsp;
and you go and get after it. That's all it is.

